212
00:29:47,750 --> 00:29:49,000
Nayef!

213
00:29:50,125 --> 00:29:52,166
Sekumpulan pembunuh!

214
00:29:55,291 --> 00:29:57,416
Pergilah tanyakan pada para pemukim siapa yang membunuh ayahku!

215
00:29:57,541 --> 00:30:00,083
Nayef! Nayef!
Nayef!

216
00:30:12,291 --> 00:30:14,000
